        - Output: :math:`(*)`, same shape as the input.

    .. image:: ../scripts/activation_images/RReLU.png

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.RReLU(0.1, 0.3)
        >>> input = torch.randn(2)
        >>> output = m(input)

